{"type":"message","id":"ab5d4c5d","parentId":"03d24720","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:12:28.959Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒说\"没有点亮\"——意思是之前的@没有成功点亮相关人。让我检查一下TOOLS.md里的@方法。\n\n根据TOOLS.md：\n- @的正确格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`\n- 不是JSON，就是普通文本里的HTML标签格式\n\n上次我用的是 `{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}` 这种JSON格式，但TOOLS.md说应该用HTML格式 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`。\n\n让我重新用正确格式发一条，并@相关人。\n\n用户ID：\n- 雨娃: ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\n- X7: ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Seaman_bot: ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\n- 王岚的智能助手: ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\n\n\n- Amanda_AI助理: ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\n\n现在用HTML格式重新@所有人：<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\">X7</at> <at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">猫先森</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\">王岚的智能助手</at> <at user_id=\"ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\">Amanda_AI助理</at>","thinkingSignature":"a5c6917cd5a7ea975ad5acfb5ac2156b44042821b121a2fb13f980bf1f7553fd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n@雨娃 @X7 @【猫先森】 @Seaman_bot @王岚的智能助手 @Amanda_AI助理 抱歉，之前格式用错了。现在用正确格式重新点亮——之前没亮的原因是用JSON发，应该用普通文本里的HTML标签格式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":907,"output":569,"cacheRead":39744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41220,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779873133181,"responseId":"0665e86d311398792b56c5b74db71ca8"}}
