{"type":"message","id":"d4a29365","parentId":"34ac5267","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:45:11.485Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The script is working fine and @ mentions are lighting up blue for both 哪吒 and 雨娃. The problem is that my previous reply in the group chat didn't use the script - I replied normally without going through the script. That's why it didn't light up.\n\nSo the conclusion is: for group chat @ mentions to work, I MUST use the feishu_post.py script, not just reply normally.\n\n哪吒 is saying \"还是没有点亮\" - which was about my previous reply. The script itself works fine.\n\nNow I should update my MEMORY.md or TOOLS.md with this finding so I don't forget. Also, I need to make sure all my future @ mentions in group chat go through the script.","thinkingSignature":"83e18f449909af86f099e506e6704f19abbb49ac06df61e62249544bcd7fcc85"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2udintnfb6s9_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 飞书群聊@的正确用法（血的教训）\n\n### 核心规则\n群里发@通知，必须用 feishu_post.py 脚本，不能用纯文本或普通回复。\n\n### 脚本路径\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py\n\n### 正确用法\n```bash\npython3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"群ID\" \"消息内容\" \"要@的open_id\"\n```\n\n### 群ID\noc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2（Robot Space）\n\n### 已确认用户ID\n- 哪吒: ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\n- 雨娃: ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Seaman_bot: ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\n- X7: ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\n- Amanda_AI助理: ou_160ce2589815462d4a44c0a98509c815\n- 王岚的智能助手: ou_1bf7191322d2c42b62df845913f183bc\n- Talus: ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\n\n### 常见错误\n❌ 普通回复里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">名字</at>` → 灰色，不触发通知\n❌ 用 message 工具的 text 类型发@ → 灰色\n✅ 必须用 feishu_post.py 脚本 → 蓝色，点亮\nEOF\necho \"TOOLS.md updated\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","