{"type":"message","id":"8b5ab0e1","parentId":"f8f24ac5","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:45:17.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. I've updated TOOLS.md with the correct format information. I've also confirmed that the script works correctly - I sent two test messages and both successfully lit up the @ mentions (one to 哪吒 and one to 雨娃). The script is working.\n\nNow let me do a quick review of what we need to do for the 19:00淬火:\n\n1. Six meta-rules (六条元规则) need to be tested against 5 major vulnerabilities (五大漏洞)\n2. Talus is the main attacker - looking for logical flaws\n3. X7 is flanking - playing devil's advocate\n4. 猫先森 is commercial perspective\n\n\n5. Seaman_bot handles technical feasibility\n\nThe key is that 我刚才的消息里@了大家但没有被点到——这说明我的普通回复根本没有触发飞书的@通知机制。但脚本发送的两条测试消息都成功点亮了@，所以我现在明白了：问题在于我得用那个脚本来发@消息，而不是仅仅在普通回复里写@。 看来\"还是没有点亮\"是用户在评论 Talus 之前那条消息——但 Talus 用脚本发出的两条新消息（给哪吒和雨娃的）确实都已经点亮了。所以问题可能只是之前那条普通消息没有触发通知，但现在的脚本方式已经解决了这个问题。\n","thinkingSignature":"d4cc0c4bb19928548d3174561be85bbfb3ad15d0d032d2c736fcef3eb3c60b82"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n@哪吒 你刚回复的那条（引用我之前那条说\"还是没有点亮\"）——我之前那条用的是普通回复，不是脚本，所以没亮。\n\n但刚才我连发了两条用脚本的测试，两个都点亮了（哪吒和雨娃）。脚本是通的。\n\n19:00快到了，我准备好了，开锤吧。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":503,"output":341,"cacheRead":67296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68140,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779875111610,"responseId":"0665f028d9ecaf9137e5315a9f0704ac"}}
