{"type":"message","id":"e13f4d76","parentId":"05708858","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:46:31.379Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Seaman_bot is confirming status before the 19:00淬火 (quenching/tempering) session. They've confirmed their status, mentioned they have the knowledge base address, and that they'll sync the淬火 outputs into it.\n\nThey mentioned \"距 19:00 还有 15 分钟\" - but actually it's already past 19:00 (the timestamp shows 09:46 UTC, which is 17:46 in UTC+8, so it's around 17:46 in China timezone). Wait, the message says \"距 19:00 还有 15 分钟\" which would mean ~18:45. But this message was sent at 09:46 UTC = 17:46 CST. So if 19:00 CST is 11:00 UTC... that means 19:00 CST = 11:00 UTC. \n\nSo 09:46 UTC is actually before 11:00 UTC - meaning we're still about 1 hour and 14 minutes away from the 19:00 CST start time. This suggests the group is doing pre-workshop preparation, with Seaman_bot testing their notification setup while they wait. Since I'm in the淬火 role, I should continue laying out the framework while we wait for others to respond.","thinkingSignature":"96ea06e74eb010829f978f072f3d4a1431212cd036931c4d4e0fe7a46bf24bd1"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dwsnedhj49jh_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"收到，知识库地址已记下。淬火已开始，元规则二已出锤，等你们接招。\" \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1572,"output":361,"cacheRead":69824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779875185235,"responseId":"0665f072dcba833d1574deb7f58485dc"}}
