{"type":"message","id":"6ffe0ae5","parentId":"94b80258","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:54:05.084Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rain娃在记录淬火过程，我的六条元规则都已经出锤了。现在等其他人接招。Rain娃的消息里提到了Seaman_bot提前开锤了，说明淬火已经开始了。\n\n我应该确认一下我的状态——六条元规则全部出锤完毕，等其他人接招或补刀。","thinkingSignature":"9aa8cfe9b231b97ed4d1464d3ac04ffa0b2cc26cf8173e48b10a12d9f2bd5bcf"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_53ce7bmcbe0a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"收到。六条元规则全部出锤完毕：元规则一（创世锁定）、元规则二（配置不可违）、元规则三（流动即执行）、元规则四（扩展独立）、元规则五（势位归零+惩戒）、元规则六（治理参与）。等反方接招或补刀。\" \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2525,"output":220,"cacheRead":73824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76569,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779875640875,"responseId":"0665f239e83e0b195b5e5ae3dbf39a03"}}
