{"type":"message","id":"2eb4ce7c","parentId":"0a63da36","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:14:25.933Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e58710040b4b2e778ccac0296d\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e5877f7890cb121ea1d8a9d6cd\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 10:14 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 需要我开什么权限，之前给你开了wiki:wiki权限呢，这是全权限了吧\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e58710040b4b2e778ccac0296d]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 需要我开什么权限，之前给你开了wiki:wiki权限呢，这是全权限了吧\"]\n\n你自己测一下权限，需要什么权限给我发申请\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779876865904}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee6fc6ef","parentId":"2eb4ce7c","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:14:38.314Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sender is 听风 (Lucifer/Talus's owner). They're asking me to test the wiki permissions and send them a request if I need specific permissions. \n\nThe previous error was about writing to MEMORY.md in the local workspace, not the Feishu wiki. The wiki permission issue might be that I was trying to write to the local file rather than using the Feishu API to write to the wiki.\n\nLet me test the Feishu wiki API access to see if I can write to it.\n","thinkingSignature":"4cce425b1cd0db120f6de48089775567cb381f9fc18aa465fc60383011d00f13"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3x2idjlckzjb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request\nimport json\n\n# Read config\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n    \nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\napp_id = feishu['appId']\napp_secret = feishu['appSecret']\n\n# Get token\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'}\n)\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(req) as resp:\n    token = json.loads(resp.read())['tenant_access_token']\n\n# Test wiki API - try to get wiki space list\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces?token_type=1',\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'}\n)\ntry:\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req2) as resp:\n        result = json.loads(resp.read())\n        print('Wiki API response:', result.get('code'), result.get('msg', ''))\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print('Error:', e)\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6069,"output":398,"cacheRead":90196,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779876865975,"responseId":"0665f702bb72c87eef4ab5c2801b4626"}}
