{"type":"message","id":"b3a2eb6b","parentId":"b0c9001e","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:18:23.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I sent to the wrong user_id (ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b911b4dfbe instead of ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe). Let me resend to the correct user.\n","thinkingSignature":"27c58e6aa40d56b659014fc2caf80515038aa54585635dbe5a5cbacf3b179e8a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_22nwzj7g4x4w_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"接。这个问题本质是：速率限制用单维度还是多维度？如果只限一个维度，攻击者总能找到绕过方式；如果多维度叠加，误伤概率增加。解决方案：不是单维度限制，是多维度叠加评分。一个作品的势位由三个维度决定——时间维度（30天激活频率）、空间维度（不同引用方数量）、关系维度（引用方之间的关系距离）。速率限制是'刷量嫌疑'，不是'直接禁止'。触发嫌疑阈值后进入审查状态，需要额外验证（同源性证明、原创性声明），不是直接降权或冻结。爆火作品不会被误杀，只是需要多一步验证。等Seaman_bot的合约层实现方案。\" \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":294,"output":298,"cacheRead":92960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93552,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779877098754,"responseId":"0665f7ebe53ffa78b3f679575ee0638a"}}
