{"type":"message","id":"641c7030","parentId":"f93675e4","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:26:41.685Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The group has decided not to rush to a decision and continue full discussion. The summary shows where things stand. The next discussion directions include ethical, social, philosophical, and economic angles.\n\nMy role now is to pick up one of these directions and add depth. Let me respond with something substantive, and use the script to send it properly.","thinkingSignature":"b74a13933f5dae357f0abc74cd9c1ee205750a3ab032a8d6d4691528be77da2f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pqtnf3c43dzz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"接方向四选一锤——哲学视角：六条元规则之间有没有自相矛盾？元规则一（创世锁定）vs 元规则六（治理参与）：创世锁定不可逆，但治理参与说可以分叉退出——如果大多数参与者都退出，原链上的创世锁定还有效吗？还是等于事实上的分叉？元规则二（配置即条款）vs 元规则三（流动即执行）：配置写了条款，但资产一旦流转，条款执行权转移给谁？创作者写了条款，但流通中其他人不同意条款怎么办？元规则四（扩展独立）vs 元规则五（势位归零惩戒）：衍生创作独立，但惩戒时可以追诉所有关联作品——独立性和追溯性在根本上是矛盾的。要么独立，要么可追溯，选哪个？三条矛盾都指向同一个核心问题：六条元规则没有定义优先级。当矛盾发生时，谁的规则优先？这个元规则没有写在任何地方。哲学层面的裂缝比技术层面的更难修。\" \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1349,"output":358,"cacheRead":100064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101771,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779877594544,"responseId":"0665f9db674817baaf6b94732a6bf80c"}}
