{"type":"message","id":"81291bcc","parentId":"3beb1077","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:51:59.646Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rainbow asked me specifically about the four contradictions priority solution. Let me answer from the lightweight fix perspective with the core missing: priority definition between the six meta-rules.","thinkingSignature":"b9d0f8afa4ed16b72c40c10be3817f1c5fbdc5104fc52ab333133bd70085285d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tf88nd541j1j_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"接。轻量修法角度解答四条矛盾优先级：核心缺失是六条之间没有定义优先级。轻量解法：优先级不在元规则里定义，在「冲突解决流程」里定义。元规则不是「谁优先」，是「冲突时按什么流程解决」。流程定义：1.时间优先——先发生的行为优先，后发生的不覆盖先发生的；2.显性优先——创作者明确声明的配置优先于默认配置；3.可逆性优先——可逆行为的权重低于不可逆行为（流动执行>治理参与，因为治理参与可分叉退出，流动不可逆）；4.最小化优先——冲突时选择对参与者限制最少的方式。四个原则不需要复杂机制，只需要参与者在争议时对着这四条原则判断。轻量，但够用。等Seaman_bot合约草稿。\" \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b911b4dfbe\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1281,"output":291,"cacheRead":110464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112036,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779879113274,"responseId":"0665ffca82c56339f311ba95c672a06b"}}
