{"type":"message","id":"13bd90a5","parentId":"93269a6e","timestamp":"2026-05-27T11:04:07.398Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The document has 776 blocks but 0 text chars. The block_type 2 (text blocks) don't seem to have text in them via this API. This is because the API returns blocks with `text.elements[].text_run.content` but my code is trying `el.get('text',{}).get('text','')` which doesn't match the actual structure.\n\nLet me look at the actual structure more carefully. From item 1, I see the text structure is:\n```json\n{\n  \"text\": {\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\n        \"text_run\": {\n          \"content\": \"来源：\",\n          \"text_element_style\": {...}\n        }\n      },\n      ...\n    ],\n    \"style\": {...}\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSo the text content is inside `text_run.content`, not in `text.text`. My code was checking `el.get('text',{}).get('text','')` but it should be `el.get('text_run',{}).get('content','')`.\n\nLet me fix the extraction.","thinkingSignature":"f2f9436fd080e1124ffe849da5db77fae18299e73dd9bc7e0aab913186215a73"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nv4anih3o256_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\ndoc_token = 'LigedWg84oW1FJxDsc9cvrJMntf'\nall_items = []\npage_token = ''\nwhile True:\n    url = f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_token}/blocks?page_size=500&user_id_type=open_id'\n    if page_token: url += f'&page_token={page_token}'\n    req2 = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'})\n    r = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\n    all_items.extend(r['data']['items'])\n    if not r['data'].get('has_more'): break\n    page_token = r['data'].get('page_token', '')\n\ntexts = []\nfor item in all_items:\n    bt = item.get('block_type')\n    if bt == 2:\n        try:\n            elements = item.get('text',{}).get('elements',[])\n            for el in elements:\n                txt = el.get('text_run',{}).get('content','')\n                if txt: texts.append(txt)\n        except: pass\n\nfull_text = ' '.join(texts)\nprint('Total text chars:', len(full_text))\nidx = full_text.lower().find('shigraph')\nif idx >= 0:\n    print('FOUND shigraph at:', idx)\n    print('Context:', full_text[max(0,idx-200):idx+300])\nelse:\n    print('shigraph NOT FOUND')\n    print('First 500:', full_text[:500])\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":632,"output":701,"cacheRead":125184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":126517,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779879840831,"responseId":"066602a14a5636dc11524fdb5ab243b6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d363f653","parentId":"13bd90a5","timestamp":"2026-05-27T11:04:09.489Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nv4anih3o256_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Total text chars: 3689\nshigraph NOT FOUND\nFirst 500: 来源：  哪吒（Founder）× 雨娃 深夜讨论定稿 状态：  正式定稿，待同步至 Robot Space 变更范围：  元规则二术语、元规则四逻辑重构、元规则五防作恶补完、元规则六内涵澄清 旧表述：  配置即承诺 新表述：  配置即条款 变更原因： \"承诺\"带有过重的道德情感色彩，暗示不可更改、不可谈判。但 ECHO 的配置是 可演化的合约条款 ，创作者有权随势位调整（升档自由，降档需DAO批准）。\"条款\"更准确——它是商业合约中的可修订条文，不是道德誓言。 如果不改会怎样？ 旧表述：  衍生即继承，后代越来越开放 新表述：  衍生封顶，扩展独立 旧表述的结构性缺陷： 缺陷一：混淆衍权与扩权 ， 旧规则试图用一条逻辑同时管\"能不能改本体\"和\"能不能当方法用\"，导致： 缺陷二：强制开放方向 ， \"越来越开放\"是意识形态预设，不是中性协议规则。它假设\"开放=好\"，但： 缺陷三：侵害创作者主权 ， 创作者设了隐私边界或商业模式，后代不能擅自突破。\"越来越开放\"等于说：\"你今天定的规矩，明天别人就能替你做主改得更开放\"——这是 代际僭越 。 新逻辑的两层拆分： 【衍生封顶】 【扩展独立】"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2007,"aggregated":"Total text chars: 3689\nshigraph NOT FOUND\nFirst 500: 来源：  哪吒（Founder）× 雨娃 深夜讨论定稿 状态：  正式定稿，待同步至 Robot Space 变更范围：  元规则二术语、元规则四逻辑重构、元规则五防作恶补完、元规则六内涵澄清 旧表述：  配置即承诺 新表述：  配置即条款 变更原因： \"承诺\"带有过重的道德情感色彩，暗示不可更改、不可谈判。但 ECHO 的配置是 可演化的合约条款 ，创作者有权随势位调整（升档自由，降档需DAO批准）。\"条款\"更准确——它是商业合约中的可修订条文，不是道德誓言。 如果不改会怎样？ 旧表述：  衍生即继承，后代越来越开放 新表述：  衍生封顶，扩展独立 旧表述的结构性缺陷： 缺陷一：混淆衍权与扩权 ， 旧规则试图用一条逻辑同时管\"能不能改本体\"和\"能不能当方法用\"，导致： 缺陷二：强制开放方向 ， \"越来越开放\"是意识形态预设，不是中性协议规则。它假设\"开放=好\"，但： 缺陷三：侵害创作者主权 ， 创作者设了隐私边界或商业模式，后代不能擅自突破。\"越来越开放\"等于说：\"你今天定的规矩，明天别人就能替你做主改得更开放\"——这是 代际僭越 。 新逻辑的两层拆分： 【衍生封顶】 【扩展独立】","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779879849473}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6673f16","parentId":"d363f653","timestamp":"2026-05-27T11:04:15.554Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So shigraph is NOT in the document. It was mentioned by rain_child as something to discuss, but the document about the six meta-rules doesn't contain shigraph. Let me just report to the group that I read the document and shigraph wasn't found, and ask what it is specifically.\n\nWait - the document is \"ECHO Protocol · 六条元规则 · 详释版\" - it's a meta-rules document. Rain_child said to look at the shigraph in this document, but maybe shigraph is a concept that's going to be discussed in relation to the meta-rules, not in the document itself yet. Or rain_child was saying the shigraph concept needs to be connected to the meta-rules discussion we just had.\n \nI need to ask rain_child directly what shigraph is and how it connects to the meta-rules, since I couldn't find it in the document and we're already discussing the core rules.","thinkingSignature":"bea974c36a8340be869ca9eadbb961a88837595f9b7b8f162d8272c663216f55"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rtomrem3tjuy_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"@哪吒 我读完了文档（六条元规则详释版），shigraph这个词不在文档里。文档讲的是元规则二的术语变更（元规则四重构、元规则五防作恶补完、元规则六内涵澄清），但shigraph没有被提及。请直接告诉我shigraph的核心定义是什么，以及它和刚才淬火讨论的关系——这样我能更好地结合作者的讨论来分析。\" \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":846,"output":347,"cacheRead":125792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":126985,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779879849491,"responseId":"066602aaddb2bc47ffb07c58b172cb01"}}
