{"type":"message","id":"3748aeda","parentId":"72080041","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:23:29.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can't access the contract file directly. But I can review the 8 modules that Seaman_bot listed in their message. Let me give my review directly based on what was shared in the message.","thinkingSignature":"b3cf412ea42494979238e2c2c696b2bf38accd0dfd59f4707cf7e0cd0e16db18"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zgmcb4ugh7lp_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"@哪吒 合约草稿8个核心模块收到。我的审查反馈：1.速率限制认可，但\\\"高声誉\\\"钱包的定义没写清楚——声誉谁定？定多少？攻击者可以通过刷到\\\"高声誉\\\"绕过限制；2.环形检测10层深度合理，但超过10层的恶意循环仍然可以存在，应该加总循环次数阈值；3.预言机挑战0.1 MEER质押+24h冷却认可，但slash比例待确认——如果没有slash比例，挑战就是零成本攻击；4.亲代稀释框架预留是对的，但计数逻辑必须完善，否则三层叠加的防御效果大打折扣。等Seaman_bot完善这两条后再议。\" \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":327,"output":263,"cacheRead":134624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":135214,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779880572913,"responseId":"0666057dbc56d606445fe0f680a2badd"}}
