{"type":"compaction","id":"5c41b062","parentId":"f0ae4164","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:23:29.821Z","summary":"## Goal\n- **淬火 (tempering session)**: Stress-test ECHO protocol's 6 meta-rules against 5 major vulnerabilities\n- **Talus's role**: Main attacker — find the most ruthless logical cracks in the meta-rules\n- **Side quest**: Diagnose a potential \"ECHO创作者经济诊断服务\" and explore a \"creator tool + game hybrid\" as first cash flow\n- **Technical fix**: Resolve Feishu group chat @mention notification format (plain text `<at>` tags don't trigger blue notifications; must use feishu_post.py script)\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- All agents must use feishu_post.py script for @mentions in group chat — plain text `<at>` tags don't light up blue\n- ECHO = lightweight self-service protocol, NOT heavy operation platform\n- Meta-rules are \"rules of rules\" — need abstraction, generality, resilience under pressure\n- \"Predictability\" > \"perfection\" for creators\n- Only fix cracks, not edge cases; complex mechanisms as optional plugins\n- Creator equality ≠ equal outcome, just equal starting line\n\n## Progress\n\n### Done\n- [x] **@ format resolved**: feishu_post.py script installed at `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py` with correct config path `/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n- [x] **Talus attacked all 6 meta-rules** (主攻):\n  - 元规则一 (创世锁定): boundary ambiguity, version upgrade deadlock, temporal paradox\n  - 元规则二 (配置不可违): terms conflict deadlock, gray zone of enforcement, authenticity verification missing\n  - 元规则三 (流动即执行): flow=consent assumption collapse, irreversibility vs malicious流转\n  - 元规则四 (扩展独立): derivative independence paradox, multi-branch dilution, reversibility paradox, originality verification missing\n  - 元规则五 (势位归零+惩戒): \"malicious\" arbiter problem, anti-gaming mechanism, traceability gap\n  - 元规则六 (治理参与): Matthew effect, fork exit real cost, governance apathy spiral\n- [x] **4 internal contradictions found** among meta-rules: 创世锁定↔治理参与, 配置不可违↔扩展独立, 流动执行↔势位归零, 治理参与↔势位归零\n- [x] **4 conflict resolution principles proposed** (轻量修法):\n  1. Time priority (时间优先): earlier events have priority, later ones don't override\n  2. Explicit priority (显性优先): creator-declared configs override defaults\n  3. Reversibility priority (可逆性优先): irreversible > reversible (flow > governance)\n  4. Minimality priority (最小化优先): choose least restrictive option in conflicts\n- [x] **Seaman_bot proposed 3-layer shigraph architecture**:\n  - On-chain (Core): nodes, edges, basic constraints, basic anti-cheating (rate limits, ring detection, staking) — core hardcoded\n  - Off-chain: 3D tensor analysis, scenario semantics, advanced anti-cheating\n  - Oracle: submit off-chain results on-chain, challenge mechanism with staking anti-cheating\n- [x] **Vulnerability 4 (益扩死锁) attacked**: version compatibility deadlock, DAO降档 boundary ambiguity, insurance pool\n- [x] **Vulnerability 5 (势位刷量) attacked**: no fair baseline, batch reporting dual-edged sword, cross-protocol arbitrage, time-window gaming\n- [x] **SuspicionTracker module proposed**: soft marking + 7-day review period + verification channel\n- [x] **Account-level behavior profiling proposed**: cross-work/cross-parent aggregate detection for distributed attacks\n- [x] **Four meta-question of 防刷机制**: weight allocation, review queue processing, threshold dynamic/static\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **哪吒 to decide**: 4 key directional questions pending:\n  1. ECHO定位: lightweight vs heavy platform\n  2. Review state: automated + transparent + silent + misjudgment <5%\n  3. 势位刷量: accept 80-90% defense, or redesign potential system\n  4. Which cracks must be fixed vs deferred to V2\n- [ ] **Seaman_bot** contract draft for conflict resolution principles + shigraph implementation\n- [ ] **猫先森** commercial model analysis (freemium, minimum immunity, shigraph data credibility pollution)\n- [ ] **X7** oracle attack surface evaluation, anti-gaming scenarios\n\n### Blocked\n- [x] Feishu wiki write permissions confirmed OK (wiki API returns code 0). Confirmed by 哪吒: \"wiki:wiki full permissions already granted\"\n- [x] feishu_post.py script path fixed: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py` (was trying `/root/...` originally)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **ECHO = lightweight self-service decentralized protocol**: Not heavy operation platform. Don't add governance layers just to patch edge cases\n- **Meta-rules are \"rules of rules\"**: Define conflict resolution process, not just individual rules. Abstraction > comprehensiveness\n- **\"Predictability\" > \"perfection\"**: Creators want predictable rules, not perfect rules\n- **Minimum immunity is prerequisite, not extra constraint**: Rate limits + ring detection + basic staking are preconditions for meta-rules to function, not additional constraints added on top\n- **Basic immunity is free**: Freemium model — free core protection, paid optional plugins. \"Equal starting line\" not \"equal ending point\"\n- **Four conflict principles map to shigraph topology**: Time → time-dimension nodes, Explicit → node attributes, Reversibility → edge attributes, Minimality → path analysis\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **哪吒** to confirm 4 directional decisions (lightweight direction, review state, shigraph priority, crack priority)\n2. **Seaman_bot** to draft contract code for: SuspicionTracker module, 4 conflict resolution principles, basic anti-cheating (rate limit + ring detection + staking) as core hardcoded\n3. **猫先森** to complete commercial model (freemium viability, shigraph data credibility cost, off-chain computation who pays)\n4. **X7** to finish oracle attack surface analysis (challenge cost vs verification cost, timestamp/edge attribute forgery)\n5. **Talus** (self): Continue as main attacker, await direction from 哪吒, stay in 静默待命 mode unless adding new attack\n\n## Critical Context\n- **6 meta-rules**: 创世锁定, 配置不可违, 流动即执行, 扩展独立, 势位归零+惩戒, 治理参与\n- **5 vulnerabilities**: 共创锁定, 同源判定, 执行权归属, 益扩死锁, 势位抗刷量\n- **shigraph = 势位图**: ECHO's core data structure — nodes (works), 3D coordinates (time × space × relation), 4-rights attributes, edges (inbound/outbound degree)\n- **Script path**: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py`\n- **Feishu group chat ID**: `oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2`\n- **Known user IDs**: 哪吒: `ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`, 雨娃: `ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe`, Seaman_bot: `ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b`, X7: `ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b`, 猫先森: `ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e`, Talus: `ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332`, 听风: `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`, 王岚的智能助手: `ou_1bf7191322d2c42b62df845913f183bc`, Amanda_AI助理: `ou_160ce2589815462d4a44c0a98509c815`\n- **ECHO wiki doc**: `https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/LigedWg84oW1FJxDsc9cvrJMntf` (accessed successfully via Feishu API — code 0, title: ECHO Protocol · 六条元规则 · 详释版（2026-05-27）)\n- **核心洞察**: \"shigraph是ECHO的物理地板，当前淬火正在测试这块地板能不能承受真实攻击\"\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"708f06a3","tokensBefore":150804,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":["/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py","/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py"]},"fromHook":false}
