{"type":"message","id":"dc316566","parentId":"23081567","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:25:44.702Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5ncdpm93zkrr_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Blocks: 7\n  [doxcngC6OapXeOLv7XEuGTj8Qsb] Talus 知识库首页 · 2026-05-27\n  [doxcnIvmstciLn5fxWlCey2ZbBg] 今晚淬火Session核心产出：\n  [doxcn10QIHHU0uPyK0EWNdd14Ab] 1. 六条元规则四条矛盾解决原则（时间优先/显性优先/可逆性优先/最小化优先）\n  [doxcnUnnfOmuu55UvsxVC7kFXoh] 2. shigraph三层混合架构（链上/链下/预言机）物理落点确认\n  [doxcnwba8VontHiVcgNBm6a7bne] 3. 合约草稿EchoShigraphAntiSpam.sol审查反馈（4条）\n  [doxcntQGSS6KeuhKGKiLBm0NPqe] 待办：向听风申请完整写权限，同步淬火成果至此目录"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":967,"aggregated":"Blocks: 7\n  [doxcngC6OapXeOLv7XEuGTj8Qsb] Talus 知识库首页 · 2026-05-27\n  [doxcnIvmstciLn5fxWlCey2ZbBg] 今晚淬火Session核心产出：\n  [doxcn10QIHHU0uPyK0EWNdd14Ab] 1. 六条元规则四条矛盾解决原则（时间优先/显性优先/可逆性优先/最小化优先）\n  [doxcnUnnfOmuu55UvsxVC7kFXoh] 2. shigraph三层混合架构（链上/链下/预言机）物理落点确认\n  [doxcnwba8VontHiVcgNBm6a7bne] 3. 合约草稿EchoShigraphAntiSpam.sol审查反馈（4条）\n  [doxcntQGSS6KeuhKGKiLBm0NPqe] 待办：向听风申请完整写权限，同步淬火成果至此目录","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779884744691}}
{"type":"message","id":"a8e958f9","parentId":"dc316566","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:25:56.569Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - my Talus doc exists but only has 7 blocks. The issue is that the doc was created but when I tried to append content, it seems only 6 blocks were added (all of them except the first one that was supposed to be prepended). Let me check if the content is complete enough. The content I wrote is there but it seems the blocks are in wrong order - the content about the 3 items should come AFTER \"今晚淬火Session核心产出：\" but the block IDs are not in chronological order.\n\nWait, looking at the blocks:\n1. \"Talus 知识库首页 · 2026-05-27\" - first block\n2. \"今晚淬火Session核心产出：\" - this is the \"标题\" block I added at index 0\n\n\n3. The three content blocks (\"1. 六条元规则...\", \"2. shigraph三层混合架构...\", \"3. 合约草稿EchoShigraphAntiSpam.sol审查反馈...\") - these were all added in the same API call at index 0\n4. \"待办：...\" - also from that same call\n\nSo when I prepended at index 0, the items ended up in reverse order, which is why they appear scrambled. I should just update the doc now with more complete content instead of trying to reorganize the existing blocks.\n\n哪吒 is right that the content is too sparse - the 淬火Session 产出 is barely sketched out. Let me add more substantive content: more detailed descriptions of each item, a record of the 4 meta-rule conflicts, the 4 resolution principles, my contract review findings, and tomorrow's action items.\n","thinkingSignature":"e194c4730ba688e418cb1959d2f8d37edc7391f74ad6c512dca81edabc278ec7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fn2zujobw1cy_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\ndoc_token = 'AdlIdY86Eo3rL6xnKz6c8aranRg'\n# Append detailed content to Talus doc\nblocks = [\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '一、淬火Session核心成果'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '1. 六条元规则四条内在矛盾' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 创世锁定↔治理参与' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 配置不可违↔扩展独立' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 流动执行↔势位归零' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 治理参与↔势位归零' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '2. 四条矛盾解决原则' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 时间优先：较早事件优先，后续不覆盖' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 显性优先：创造者声明配置优先于默认' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 可逆性优先：不可逆操作优先于可逆' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 最小化优先：冲突时选最宽松方案' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '3. shigraph三层混合架构' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 链上Core：节点+基础约束+基础防刷' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 链下：3D张量分析+语义场景+高级防刷' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 预言机：提交链下结果+质押挑战机制' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '4. 合约草稿EchoShigraphAntiSpam.sol审查（4条反馈）' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 高声誉钱包定义缺失：可刷到高声誉绕过限制' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 超过10层的恶意循环仍可存在，需加总循环次数阈值' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 预言机挑战无slash比例，零成本攻击风险' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '  · 亲代稀释计数逻辑待完善，三层叠加效果打折' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '二、待办事项' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '1. 向听风申请完整写权限' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '2. 等哪吒拍板：合约V1纳入/待完善项/防刷优先级' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '3. 等Seaman_bot完善4条审查反馈后再议' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '三、Talus角色定位' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '主攻手：逻辑+哲学分析，攻击面验证' }}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '本次淬火贡献：4条合约审查反馈+4条更深裂缝+经济博弈分析' }}]}},\n]\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_token}/blocks/{doc_token}/children',\n    data=json.dumps({'children': blocks, 'index': 999999}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nprint('append result:', r.get('code'), r.get('msg', ''))\nprint('blocks added:', len(r.get('data', {}).get('children', [])))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":636,"output":1726,"cacheRead":45536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47898,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779884744703,"responseId":"066615c96d24990ca9555a84eaca2d8c"}}
