{"type":"message","id":"0910d5ae","parentId":"ca256b81","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:28:58.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The blocks ARE there and the content is correct. The document shows 18 blocks with proper content. But the user sees an empty document. This might be a caching issue on the Feishu app side - they might not be seeing the latest version. Or the document might have been created but is somehow not accessible.\n\nWait - the user sent a screenshot showing \"嘟吨 1731\" as a watermark. That watermark \"1731\" - could that mean the document has 1731 as the document ID? But our doc_token is 'AdlIdY86Eo3rL6xnKz6c8aranRg'. \n\nActually wait, could there be two different documents? Let me check - the user might be looking at a different document. \n\nI think I found it - when I first created the Talus document, I got the token 'AdlIdY86Eo3rL6xnKz6c8aranRg' and added it to the wiki at the root level. But then I also created another test document with a different token. The user might be looking at a stale version of the first document, or there's a caching issue where their app hasn't refreshed to show the new blocks I added.\n\nThe screenshot timestamp shows \"嘟吨 1731\" which looks like a document ID or watermark, but it doesn't match either of the document tokens I have on record. I need to verify which document is actually linked in the wiki space under \"G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\" and make sure the user has the correct one.\n","thinkingSignature":"40d61bbd7df246d0af08decbcd427f2d4c83881183fd4470cd9b95cb610889af"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p0yfyzyv7qp2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\nspace_id = 7642970390779661243\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/{space_id}/nodes?page_size=50',\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'})\nr = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nnodes = r.get('data', {}).get('nodes', [])\nprint(f'Total nodes: {len(nodes)}')\nfor n in nodes:\n    print(f'  [{n.get(\\\"node_token\\\")}] {n.get(\\\"title\\\")} type={n.get(\\\"node_type\\\")} obj={n.get(\\\"obj_type\\\")}')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":716,"output":636,"cacheRead":50464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51816,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779884932062,"responseId":"066616840cd09185aa32d9def5008cc1"}}
