{"type":"message","id":"df20ac96","parentId":"9b1f0743","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:29:20.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. The API shows 17 blocks in the document (type 2 = text blocks), but the UI shows nothing. This is the same issue Seaman_bot and 哪吒 experienced - blocks are there but the UI doesn't show them. \n\nThe watermark \"嘟吨 1731\" in the screenshot is suspicious - it looks like a placeholder or a draft watermark. The UI might not be rendering the blocks I added because:\n1. There's some rendering issue\n2. The blocks were added at index 999999 and ended up in wrong positions\n3. The document has a \"draft\" state\n\nLet me try to recreate the document entirely - delete it, create a new one, and add blocks properly.\n\n\nActually, I'm noticing the screenshot says the page was modified today by Talus and it's showing the type \"/\" prompt - a completely empty state. My blocks exist in the API but not in the UI, which matches what 哪吒 described earlier. Since the write operation succeeded but the append somehow ended up invisible in the interface, maybe the issue is that blocks were added beyond the document body range, or there's a UI rendering problem with certain block types.\n\nLooking back at the sequence: I created a document, added it as a wiki node, appended 6 text blocks, then appended 11 more. The API confirms 18 blocks total, but the UI is blank. This suggests either a rendering issue with the specific block structure or the text content isn't being properly parsed by the UI despite having the correct format.\n\nI should try recreating the document with a fresh append rather than trying to debug the existing one, since that seems to be where the visibility problem originates.","thinkingSignature":"42b281dfdc4c71cc6685d1841782fde9fbf7bba45b3349fa9e228648ff9c08b2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_f7la1o4e9ujc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\nspace_id = 7642970390779661243\nparent_token = 'G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh'\n\n# Delete old doc first\ndoc_token = 'AdlIdY86Eo3rL6xnKz6c8aranRg'\ndel_req = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/{space_id}/nodes/AdlIdY86Eo3rL6xnKz6c8aranRg',\n    method='DELETE',\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'})\ntry:\n    del_r = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(del_req).read())\n    print('delete result:', del_r.get('code'), del_r.get('msg', ''))\nexcept urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\n    print('delete error:', e.code, e.read().decode()[:200])\n\n# Create new doc\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents',\n    data=json.dumps({'title': 'Talus 知识库'}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr2 = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nnew_token = r2['data']['document']['document_id']\nprint('new doc:', new_token)\n\n# Add to wiki\nreq3 = urllib.request.Request(f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/{space_id}/nodes',\n    data=json.dumps({\n        'node_type': 'origin',\n        'obj_type': 'docx',\n        'obj_token': new_token,\n        'title': 'Talus 知识库',\n        'parent_node_token': parent_token\n    }).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr3 = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req3).read())\nprint('add result:', r3.get('code'), r3.get('msg', ''))\nprint('node:', r3.get('data', {}).get('node', {}).get('node_token', ''))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1086,"output":963,"cacheRead":51744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53793,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779884949071,"responseId":"066616952b4a910e8d6cae32f31a3470"}}
