{"type":"message","id":"38995d25","parentId":"e616f78f","timestamp":"2026-05-27T12:32:39.256Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The insert at index 0 also works. Let me now build the full Talus knowledge page with index 0 insertion and also add to wiki. But maybe the issue is that the doc was created and immediately written without adding to wiki first - wiki visibility might be different.\n\nActually, I think the real issue might be something simpler - maybe the doc blocks were being inserted but the parent_id of the root block isn't the doc_id itself. Let me try inserting into a doc I just created and verify it shows in web.\n\nActually, let me stop debugging and just try a completely fresh approach: create the doc, insert content, add to wiki, and verify the URL is accessible. The key question is whether 哪吒 can see the content when he opens the link.\n\n\nI'm going to stop overthinking this and just create a brand new doc with a simpler title, insert the content at index 0, add it to wiki, and give 哪吒 the link so he can check if it works on his end.","thinkingSignature":"274b0cd239b46278f9a7c8a19b7c51de2de6a7dd0a8255cad158e547e8cf5d19"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4918xeq2lint_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\n# Create fresh doc\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents',\n    data=json.dumps({'title': 'Talus 知识库 v3'}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ndoc_id = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())['data']['document']['document_id']\n\nblocks = [\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '一、淬火Session核心成果（2026-05-27）'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '1. 六条元规则四条内在矛盾'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '   创世锁定↔治理参与 / 配置不可违↔扩展独立 / 流动执行↔势位归零 / 治理参与↔势位归零'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '2. 四条矛盾解决原则：时间优先·显性优先·可逆性优先·最小化优先'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '3. shigraph三层架构：链上Core + 链下引擎 + 预言机'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '4. 合约草稿4条审查反馈'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '二、Talus角色定位'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '主攻手：逻辑+哲学分析，攻击面验证'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '三、待办'}}]}},\n    {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': '1. 向听风申请完整写权限  2. 等哪吒拍板  3. 等Seaman_bot完善反馈'}}]}},\n]\nreq3 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks/{doc_id}/children',\n    data=json.dumps({'children': blocks, 'index': 0}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr3 = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req3).read())\nprint('write result:', r3.get('code'))\nprint('blocks added:', len(r3.get('data', {}).get('children', [])))\n\n# Add to wiki\nspace_id = 7642970390779661243\nreq4 = urllib.request.Request(f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/{space_id}/nodes',\n    data=json.dumps({\n        'node_type': 'origin', 'obj_type': 'docx', 'obj_token': doc_id,\n        'title': 'Talus 知识库 v3', 'parent_node_token': 'G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh'\n    }).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr4 = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req4).read())\nprint('wiki add:', r4.get('code'), r4.get('msg', ''))\nnode_token = r4.get('data', {}).get('node', {}).get('node_token', '')\nprint(f'Wiki link: https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/{node_token}')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":522,"output":1221,"cacheRead":55712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57455,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779885148418,"responseId":"0666175d0989d667ca34a37a8fbf2a3a"}}
