{"type":"message","id":"19c74ed5","parentId":"4c867e93","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:02:22.890Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's only 2 blocks now. The doc had 10 blocks added earlier, but it seems those disappeared. Let me check what the 2nd block contains.\n\nWait - looking at the timeline:\n1. First test created doc with 7 blocks - the user said it's empty\n2. Then I created a new doc with 21 blocks - user said still empty\n3. Then I created another doc with index=0 and 10 blocks - user said still empty\n\nSo ALL my writes result in empty documents. But Seaman_bot and 雨娃 can write successfully. What's different?\n\nLet me check the actual content of the existing block.","thinkingSignature":"89e817fdfe6c2705a042399d8cffc97fe37346a84f2966976f146e892ae60a48"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o3nqboafo948_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\ndoc_id = 'Hfm0wPCS7igpmBkwlqNcnaPRnEg'\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks?page_size=50',\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'})\nr = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nfor item in r.get('data', {}).get('items', []):\n    if item.get('block_type') == 2:\n        try:\n            txt = ' '.join([e.get('text_run',{}).get('content','') for el in item.get('text',{}).get('elements',[]) for e in [el] if e.get('text_run',{}).get('content','')])\n            print(f'block text: [{txt}]')\n        except Exception as ex:\n            print('err:', ex)\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38886,"output":484,"cacheRead":26004,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65374,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779886933886,"responseId":"06661e56208a094e30acacdc9c14be16"}}
