{"type":"message","id":"f3c46a45","parentId":"ae59a4c9","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:02:36.594Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The block exists but has no text content. The text_run is empty. So the block is created but the content is not being stored. This is a consistent bug in my writes.\n\nLet me compare with what Seaman_bot did. Let me try calling the API exactly the same way as the feishu_post.py script - maybe my manual Python is different.\n\nActually, let me look at the feishu_post.py script to see how it sends messages. Maybe the API call I'm making is slightly different.\n\nWait - I just realized something. My feishu_post.py script SENDS messages to chat, it doesn't write to docs. So that doesn't help.\n\nLet me try to debug this more carefully. Maybe the issue is that when I write blocks, the text content is getting lost somewhere. Let me try writing a simple string.\n\nActually, I wonder if the issue is related to how I'm constructing the JSON for the text elements. Let me try with a minimal block structure.\n\nYou know what, let me just ask 雨娃 for help. 雨娃 has been successfully writing to the wiki. Let me ask what I'm doing wrong.\n\nActually, the message is from 听风. He's confirming the doc is empty. Let me reply honestly and ask 雨娃 how to do it correctly.","thinkingSignature":"162f2d4368a8f580991141ae55ebb617423658a14f77b9467ce38aab65b37a0b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qrwncqwst2ta_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\n# Try simplest possible block\ndoc_id = 'Hfm0wPCS7igpmBkwlqNcnaPRnEg'\nblock = {\n    'block_type': 2,\n    'text': {\n        'elements': [\n            {'text_run': {'content': 'Test123'}}\n        ],\n        'style': {}\n    }\n}\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks/{doc_id}/children',\n    data=json.dumps({'children': [block]}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nprint('result:', r.get('code'), r.get('msg', ''))\nchildren = r.get('data', {}).get('children', [])\nprint('children:', len(children))\nif children:\n    print('block:', json.dumps(children[0], ensure_ascii=False)[:200])\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39390,"output":635,"cacheRead":26004,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66029,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779886943907,"responseId":"06661e605e1bf63efed2f6bfa53f1a3e"}}
