{"type":"message","id":"9b83f1a8","parentId":"aa598c0a","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:36:02.986Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API says there are 62 blocks with 61 text blocks containing content. But the user sees an empty document. This is definitely a Feishu document API bug where content written via API doesn't show up in the UI.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Let me create a document and use the Feishu document editor to write the content manually, but since I can't do that, let me try creating the document with the content in a different way.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is with the wiki node link vs the document link. When the user opens the wiki link, maybe the document is not properly rendering. Let me try giving them the direct document link instead.\n\nOr maybe I should try creating a simple text file and sharing it. Let me try the feishu file upload approach instead.\n\n\nI think the core problem is that content written through the Feishu API isn't rendering in the UI, even though the API confirms the blocks are there. Let me test whether the document link directly shows the content, or if I need to try a fresh document to see if that resolves the rendering issue.","thinkingSignature":"c7c31745465a6f38ed13a3e2f4fd98df46a340efd840b36966ea651fd088ea9c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_slfpfc123e1n_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport urllib.request, json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\n# Create brand new doc\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents',\n    data=json.dumps({'title': 'Talus 淬火记录 TEST'}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nnew_doc = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())['data']['document']['document_id']\nprint('new doc:', new_doc)\n\n# Add one block with index=0\nblock = {'block_type': 2, 'text': {'elements': [{'text_run': {'content': 'TALUS TEST - is this visible?'}}]}}\nreq3 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{new_doc}/blocks/{new_doc}/children',\n    data=json.dumps({'children': [block], 'index': 0}).encode(),\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}', 'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\nr3 = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req3).read())\nprint('write result:', r3.get('code'), 'added:', len(r3.get('data', {}).get('children', [])))\nprint(f'Direct doc link: https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/{new_doc}')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":497,"output":671,"cacheRead":77088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78256,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779888954301,"responseId":"0666263bc195cc9861692e58f88551af"}}
