{"type":"message","id":"a3aa1d6e","parentId":"9db05551","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:38:49.723Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8x22ph36ku0v_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"File \"/tmp/write_talus_kb.py\", line 20\n    '\\u5143\\u89c4\\u5219\\u56db\\u3010\\u6269\\u5c55\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u3011\\uff1a\\u884d\\u751f\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u60e8\\u8bcd\\uff08\\u884d\\u751f\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\u4e0e\\u539f\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\u7684\\u201c\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u201d\\u8fb9\\u754c\\u5728\\u54ea\\uff1f\\uff09\\u3001\\u591a\\u5206\\u652f\\u7 dilute\\uff08\\u591a\\u6b21\\u884d\\u751f\\u540e\\u521b\\u59cb\\u6027\\u5982\\u4f55\\u7559\\u5b9a\\uff1f\\uff09\\u3001\\u521b\\u59cb\\u6027\\u6838\\u9a8c\\u7f3a\\u5931',\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ^\nSyntaxError: (unicode error) 'unicodeescape' codec can't decode bytes in position 246-248: truncated \\uXXXX escape\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":59,"aggregated":"File \"/tmp/write_talus_kb.py\", line 20\n    '\\u5143\\u89c4\\u5219\\u56db\\u3010\\u6269\\u5c55\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u3011\\uff1a\\u884d\\u751f\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u60e8\\u8bcd\\uff08\\u884d\\u751f\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\u4e0e\\u539f\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\u7684\\u201c\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u201d\\u8fb9\\u754c\\u5728\\u54ea\\uff1f\\uff09\\u3001\\u591a\\u5206\\u652f\\u7 dilute\\uff08\\u591a\\u6b21\\u884d\\u751f\\u540e\\u521b\\u59cb\\u6027\\u5982\\u4f55\\u7559\\u5b9a\\uff1f\\uff09\\u3001\\u521b\\u59cb\\u6027\\u6838\\u9a8c\\u7f3a\\u5931',\n                                                                                                                                 