{"type":"message","id":"8a759bc1","parentId":"0e14cf28","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:39:44.866Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (听风) is saying the doc is still blank. The issue seems to be that Feishu Docs has a rendering issue - the content is in the API but not showing in the UI. \n\nHowever, the API consistently shows blocks with content being added successfully. This is likely a Feishu rendering bug where the document needs to be opened in the Feishu editor to trigger rendering, or there's a caching issue.\n\nLet me try a completely different approach - instead of using the Feishu Doc API, let me try writing the content to a simple text file and share that, or let me try using the Feishu wiki document approach differently.\n\n\nI suspect the root block might be interfering with content visibility, or there's a propagation delay on Feishu's end. Let me attempt clearing the document and starting fresh, or check if the content is actually there by fetching the block list.","thinkingSignature":"c6cbbbc1701355f8d9137354ae7a846cfe5262118a11ad8669adf0108bbd1ae4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5jhq840nlmrf_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport urllib.request, json\n\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f: config = json.load(f)\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['main']\nreq = urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    data=json.dumps({'app_id': feishu['appId'], 'app_secret': feishu['appSecret']}).encode(),\n    headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'})\ntoken = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())['tenant_access_token']\n\ndoc_id = 'VI8YdL2Lton1vUx2GR0cu8FCnDb'\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks?page_size=100',\n    headers={'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}'})\nr = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req2).read())\nitems = r.get('data', {}).get('items', [])\ntext_blocks = [i for i in items if i.get('block_type') == 2]\nprint(f'Total: {len(items)} blocks, {len(text_blocks)} text blocks')\n# Read first few text blocks\nfor b in text_blocks[:5]:\n    try:\n        txt = ' '.join([e.get('text_run',{}).get('content','') for el in b.get('text',{}).get('elements',[]) for e in [el] if e.get('text_run',{}).get('content','')])\n        print(f'  [{b.get(\"block_id\")}] {txt[:80]}')\n    except: pass\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":176,"output":582,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":101194,"totalTokens":101952,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779889169611,"responseId":"0666271296810bb9aee271a47fe936e6"}}
