{"type":"message","id":"56411916","parentId":"ee7b5b17","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:40:47.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tingfeng (听风, ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff) is the owner/boss and is complaining that the doc is still blank. They're replying to the message about the wiki link being blank.\n\nThe issue is clear now - Feishu Docs has a rendering bug where blocks created via API don't appear in the UI. The content IS in the backend (API confirms 63+ blocks), but the UI shows nothing.\n\nThis is a known Feishu Docs issue. The only workarounds are:\n1. Open in the editor (click edit)\n2. Open via the Feishu mobile app\n3. Wait for Feishu to fix the bug\n\n\n4. Try using Feishu's import API instead, or recreate the document through Feishu's interface rather than via API\n\nSince Tingfeng is asking for results, I'll try accessing the Feishu docs via web fetch to see if I can retrieve the content that way, or I could create a new document in Feishu's UI and paste the content manually there.\n\nActually, I'm realizing the web fetch tool might be able to access Feishu Docs directly, which could solve this entirely.","thinkingSignature":"68c7e9913d00751ba24da4a8e4336e8ecc08c0dfe350ec4451ab5623f1fd8d6b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nr1x3m6pylcg_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/VI8YdL2Lton1vUx2GR0cu8FCnDb","maxChars":2000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":176,"output":323,"cacheRead":101224,"cacheWrite":1874,"totalTokens":103597,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779889235361,"responseId":"066627544da5fe99957c88cfe97a9153"}}
