{"type":"message","id":"f3aca353","parentId":"8045b0e3","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:44:22.359Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e5b1c1958a0b32558f5fec6e6b\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e5b07e060a4c2607a574d8d1db\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 13:44 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@听风 @听风 确认是飞书文档的bug——API写入成功但浏览器不显示内容，这是飞书服务端的问题，不是我写入失败。你试试：1. 点击文档右上角\\\"编辑\\\"按钮，2. 或者用手机飞书App打开这个链接， 3. 或者在电脑客户端里打开。通常在编辑器里打开后内容就会正常显示了。如果还是不行，我换个方式——把内容发给你，你手动复制到飞书文档里。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e5b1c1958a0b32558f5fec6e6b]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: [Replying to: \"@听风 @听风 确认是飞书文档的bug——API写入成功但浏览器不显示内容，这是飞书服务端的问题，不是我写入失败。你试试：1. 点击文档右上角\"编辑\"按钮，2. 或者用手机飞书App打开这个链接， 3. 或者在电脑客户端里打开。通常在编辑器里打开后内容就会正常显示了。如果还是不行，我换个方式——把内容发给你，你手动复制到飞书文档里。\"]\n\nOK，然后你再看看别人发消息的格式，应该是markdown吧，多有层次感，你总是给我揉一块儿，是不是还是脚本的问题\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779889462224}}
{"type":"message","id":"35442ffa","parentId":"f3aca353","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:44:30.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying:\n1. OK about the Feishu doc issue\n2. Look at how other people send messages - they use markdown with proper hierarchy/formatting/layers\n3. Mine always comes out as one block of text - is this also a script problem?\n\nThey're right - my messages via feishu_post.py are just plain text without markdown formatting. Let me check the script to see if I can add markdown formatting, and also look at what other agents send that looks good.\n\nLooking at the feishu_post.py script I should check its output format.","thinkingSignature":"81e980b3cc500bd5fd1adac126781347a78c8c13798296dd9a8e8a23080a08fd"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g6qq9wbjy15m_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":176,"output":158,"cacheRead":103202,"cacheWrite":2029,"totalTokens":105565,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779889462427,"responseId":"06662837e604a25e41794a364be12118"}}
{"type":"message","id":"903b11b0","parentId":"35442ffa","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:44:30.617Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_g6qq9wbjy15m_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nFeishu 群聊发消息脚本（支持 @ 人）\n用法：python3 feishu_post.py <chat_id> <消息内容> <要@的open_id>\n示例：python3 feishu_post.py oc_xxx \"你好\" ou_xxx\n\n依赖：Python 3.x + urllib\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport sys\nimport urllib.request\n\n# 从 openclaw.json 获取 app_id 和 app_secret\nCONFIG_PATH = \"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json\"\n\ndef get_token():\n    with open(CONFIG_PATH) as f:\n        d = json.load(f)\n        accounts = d['channels']['feishu']['accounts']\n        main_acct = accounts.get('main') or accounts.get(list(accounts.keys())[0])\n        app_id = main_acct['appId']\n        app_secret = main_acct['appSecret']\n\n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n        data=json.dumps({'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}).encode(),\n        headers={'Content-Type': 'application/json'}\n    )\n    resp = urllib.request.urlopen(req)\n    return json.loads(resp.read())['tenant_access_token']\n\ndef send_post(chat_id, text, at_open_id=None):\n    token = get_token()\n\n    content_blocks = []\n    if at_open_id:\n        content_blocks.append({\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": at_open_id})\n    content_blocks.append({\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \" + text})\n\n    content_obj = {\n        \"zh_cn\": {\n            \"title\": \"\",\n            \"content\": [content_blocks]\n        }\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"receive_id\": chat_id,\n        \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n        \"content\": json.dumps(content_obj, ensure_ascii=True)\n    }\n\n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id',\n        data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n        headers={\n            'Authorization': f'Bearer {token}',\n            'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n        }\n    )\n    resp = urllib.request.urlopen(req)\n    result = json.loads(resp.read())\n\n    if result.get('code') == 0:\n        print(f\"✅ 发送成功，消息ID: {result['data']['message_id']}\")\n        mentions = result['data'].get('mentions', [])\n        if mentions:\n            print(f\" @ 已点亮: {mentions[0].get('id', 'unknown')}\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        print(f\"❌ 发送失败: {result.get('msg', 'unknown error')}\")\n        return False\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    if len(sys.argv) < 3:\n        print(\"用法: python3 feishu_post.py <chat_id> <消息内容> [要@的open_id]\")\n        print(\"示例: python3 feishu_post.py oc_xxx '你好' ou_xxx\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    chat_id = sys.argv[1]\n    text = sys.argv[2]\n    at_id = sys.argv[3] if len(sys.argv) > 3 else None\n\n    send_post(chat_id, text, at_id)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779889470610}}
{"type":"message","id":"7252b3ca","parentId":"903b11b0","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:44:46.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that the script takes plain text and puts everything into a single text block. To support markdown formatting, I'd need to use the rich text format with multiple content blocks, using tags like `text`, `a`, `img`, etc. in the Feishu post message format.\n\nThe Feishu post message format supports multiple content blocks with different tags:\n- `tag: text` for text\n- `tag: at` for mentions\n- `tag: a` for links\n- `tag: img` for images\n\nBut for markdown-like formatting (bold, bullet points, headers), the Feishu post format has limited support. The `text` element can have `text_element_style` with `bold: true` etc.\n\n\nI'm realizing that while Feishu's post format does support basic styling like bold, italics, and code through text_element_style properties, it doesn't handle block-level formatting like bullet points or headers the way traditional markdown does. The message structure itself is built from content blocks rather than markdown parsing, so I'd need to either use Feishu's native formatting options or accept that the message will be treated as plain text. I need to clarify the distinction here - Feishu's `post` message type does support basic markdown-like formatting through text styles like bold and inline code, but it doesn't handle block-level elements like bullet points or headers. The user might be seeing messages that appear formatted but are actually just using these inline text styles rather than true markdown. Let me focus on what the script actually supports versus what the user is observing in the chat.","thinkingSignature":"7e97e632f6c5865ca99f18671efa4f69981897cbc516eba41105c4e4e4bd787f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u26jaf6qo95a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d6615