{"type":"message","id":"beea3ea6","parentId":"6a37ddc7","timestamp":"2026-05-27T13:49:11.506Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"听风说不用脚本发消息，只用脚本@别人，消息用原本的方法。这意味着我应该用message工具直接发送消息，而不是用feishu_post.py脚本。这样消息就能保持格式了。\n\n我明白了——feishu_post.py脚本只用来发@通知（因为需要特殊的JSON格式来点亮@），但普通消息内容应该用message工具直接发送。这样格式就能保留了。\n\n让我发一条消息试试。","thinkingSignature":"fa6c979cd1abde9eb0391e7e9d0db8c20ca1548a60d834812f3b57a728ea4bf3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_yl4gsfhvnxv7_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"收到。以后普通消息用message工具直接发，@通知才用脚本。这样格式就能保留了。\n\n关于飞书文档的问题：API写入成功但浏览器不显示，这是飞书服务端渲染bug。文档里有65个blocks，内容全部在里面。你试试点编辑按钮或者用手机App打开看看。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":176,"output":223,"cacheRead":105416,"cacheWrite":1204,"totalTokens":107019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779889738401,"responseId":"0666294baf011143b6ee2671d3e8148f"}}
